+#ifdef HUD1C_VARIANT
+/* hud1c: each sub-step of frames 1-3 on the screen in plain text, so a photo of a hang says where it stood. The line goes
+   into the frame buffer shown (vram_s: KallistiOS's front buffer after pvr_init), row 440; it is pixels only, the TA's
